        {
          "id": "p3-19",
          "speaker": "Clare",
          "text": "Well, something to do with nutrition. So maybe we could look at food supplements… things like extra iron and extra protein, and their impact on health. JAKE:Mmm. That might be rather broad. Maybe just look at the effects of one supplement, like sugar, on the health of the mice?"
